{
  "id": "io.github.parieses.secrets-scanner",
  "name": "敏感信息扫描",
  "name_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "敏感信息扫描",
    "en-US": "Secret Scanner"
  },
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "扫描项目目录，找出意外硬编码的密钥、私钥、token、密码字段与身份证号等敏感信息，防止它们被提交进仓库或泄露",
  "description_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "扫描项目目录，找出意外硬编码的密钥、私钥、token、密码字段与身份证号等敏感信息，防止它们被提交进仓库或泄露",
    "en-US": "Scan project directories to find accidentally hardcoded secrets, private keys, tokens, password fields and ID numbers before they leak into a repo"
  },
  "author": "QuickDock",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "category": "安全工具",
  "platforms": [
    "windows"
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "command",
    "frontend"
  ],
  "backend": {
    "runtime": "native",
    "entry": "secrets-scanner",
    "args": []
  },
  "frontend": {
    "enabled": true,
    "entry": "frontend/index.html",
    "width": 900,
    "height": 600
  },
  "permissions": {
    "filesystem": true,
    "process": [
      "git"
    ]
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "id": "scan",
      "title": "扫描目录",
      "description": "扫描目录里的密钥、令牌泄露（跳过二进制与大文件）",
      "keywords": [
        "扫描",
        "敏感信息",
        "密钥",
        "secret",
        "扫描目录"
      ],
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "扫描目录",
        "en-US": "Scan directory"
      },
      "params": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要扫描的目录，如 D:/proj/app"
          },
          "gitHistory": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否连同 git 历史一起扫，默认 false",
            "default": false
          },
          "maxFileSizeMB": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "单文件大小上限（MB），默认 2，最大 64",
            "default": 2
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scan-poll",
      "title": "轮询扫描进度",
      "description": "轮询扫描进度与已命中的结果",
      "keywords": [
        "进度",
        "轮询",
        "poll"
      ],
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "轮询扫描进度",
        "en-US": "Poll scan progress"
      },
      "params": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "sessionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "scan 返回的会话 id"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "sessionId"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scan-cancel",
      "title": "取消扫描",
      "description": "取消正在进行的扫描",
      "keywords": [
        "取消",
        "停止",
        "cancel"
      ],
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "取消扫描",
        "en-US": "Cancel scan"
      },
      "params": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "sessionId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "scan 返回的会话 id"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "sessionId"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "title": "获取规则列表",
      "description": "列出内置的密钥识别规则",
      "keywords": [
        "规则",
        "rules",
        "检测器"
      ],
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "获取规则列表",
        "en-US": "List rules"
      }
    }
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "敏感信息",
    "密钥扫描",
    "secret scanner",
    "硬编码",
    "泄露",
    "安全"
  ],
  "changelog": "## v0.1.1\n\n- 新增 `commands[].params` 参数声明与 `commands[].description` 命令说明，AI 客户端可照着填 `input`；未传参时行为不变\n\n## v0.1.0\n\n- 初始版本（由 plugin-scaffold 生成）\n- 15 条检测规则：AWS / Google / Stripe / Slack / GitHub 密钥、私钥块、JWT、.env 敏感变量、身份证（含校验位）、银行卡（Luhn）、手机号、邮箱\n- 递归扫描目录，自动跳过二进制与 node_modules/.git 等目录，可按规则开关\n- 可选扫描 Git 历史（git log -p），捕捉已提交过的密钥\n- 命中值默认脱敏，可一键导出"
}
